---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — Recovery Numbers"
  description="Contact Recovery Numbers. Report a calculation error, ask a question, or send feedback."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Questions, corrections, or feedback — we read every message.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="card" style="max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h2>Report a calculation error</h2>
    <p>If a calculator gives you a result that looks wrong, please tell us which page, what numbers you entered, and what you expected. We check every report against the source method and correct confirmed errors promptly.</p>

    <h2>General questions</h2>
    <p>For questions about how a calculation works, see the methodology section on the calculator's page or the <a href="/methodology/">Methodology page</a>.</p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@recoverynumbers.com">contact@recoverynumbers.com</a>. We aim to respond within two business days.</p>

    <h2>What we can't help with</h2>
    <p>We're a calculator site, not a law firm. We can't give legal or financial advice, review your specific case, or recommend attorneys. Our tools produce rough estimates for informational purposes only — please consult a licensed attorney or financial advisor before making any legal or financial decision.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
